cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "RASH-HIT Fractal Analiz Studio"
abstract: "A research-grade, zero-rasterization computational geometry engine for exact vector box-counting, spatial occupancy profiling (fill vs. empty void ratio), and fractal dimension (Db) analysis directly from SVG vector motifs, architectural drawings, and textile patterns using C++ GEOS spatial predicates via Shapely."
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-08-23"
license: "Apache-2.0"
